      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T22:17:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I modified per your feedback and Bobby\u0027s. I tested it and it works fine. There is one change that needs to be done:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/refs/heads/main:src/platform2/libec/ec_command_async.h;l\u003d86#:~:text\u003d85-,86,-87\n\nwe usually set `options_.validate_poll_result` for this command to be false. with that, it does not detect when a `EC_RES_ERROR` is returned. It keeps polling until the end. With the change that we are making, i.e. changing the res to `EC_RES_SUCCESS`, this causes the command to run one more time. I am making the change in libec. I will test. We need to think if there is any drawback to changing this.",
